      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Sale/quoting process was good, that’s why we choose them. Had to wait for months to get it installed and then longer to get the smart meter. John from Ekonomix should have told me to change the smart meter before the solar installation.Installation was done ok, but one of the electrician used a sofa bed with his boots on to install the inverter !Bits of sharp aluminium were blown on the lawn! Since then I had another solar system installed on our main house and this was like a dream installation, on time, good value, good quality and excellent service! I used Lakeside Solar in Pambula! No more Solar Quotes for me.Cheers, Daniel",
