      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "After paying the deposit, John never called, nor emailed me. I called regularly to know the date of installation. He responded after a while to tell me a date for 2 weeks later but nothing happened.I was about to cancel the job when he called to tell me that the installer would come on the 15/12/20 which was cancelled for the next day, about 3 months after paying a deposit.The system was installed on the 16th, the electrician didn’t bother taking his boots off to get in the house and even climbed on the sofa bed! I had to ask him to get a ladder. When they left, I had to pick up their rubbish and metal bits from the garden. John was supposed to come and show us the working of the system. We waited and he came at 5 pm when we had friends visiting, of course he didn’t tell us any timing. He said he would be back in a few days.He never came back.I informed our power supplier immediately to change the meter, but due to John late install, we still are not connected.I cannot recommend him and we definitely won’t use him for our main house this year.",
