      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I got more than half a dozen quotes, not just from Solarquotes, but also from some of the bigger companies. I'd done a lot of research, enabling me to ask quite detailed questions, some of which could not be answered by the bigger outfits! Ekonomix seemed to have detailed answers that aligned with what I had found out.The installation happened within a week of paying the deposit and I am thrilled with the outcome - with a 6.5kw solar array and a 13.2kw battery, I am more than self-sufficient in the summer months - we'll wait to see what happens in winter.Customer service was good until I paid the deposit. I had hoped for a call to see if I was satisfied, but got nothing. Otherwise, they were great.",
