      "review_description": "Re our Off-grid Solar System:The service from Finn was excellent, but we found the overall experience very trying.Apart from Ekonomix, we had to make numerous phone calls just to obtain quotes. We really wanted to try \"Tesla\" or similar, but couldn't even get a quote, just lots of promises and lots of excuses.It would have been helpful if all the companies that finally quoted had used a similar base and format , but there was a lot of work required to adjust the figures to get an apples to apples comparison, Finn's website was very helpful in this respect.The biggest disappointment was one, who sounded quite efficient at first, but kept putting off the actual quote for various reasons. We waited a full month for a quote but then decided if their sales service is so terrible, it would be folly to buy from them anyway.Ekonomix was just the opposite, pleasant personnel, excellent service and very easy to deal with. They also rang back as promised and kept us informed of their progress with the quotation. The system is due to be installed in two weeks and we feel confident that the installation and after sales service will be as promised.Barry",
