      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "There are some hidden traps with installations. I have an old house which had a mess of a switchboard. Fortunately I had done some homework and went in with eyes wide open.I secured an independent opinion and a quote for a switchboard renewal from a local electrician well before getting the solar quotes. Economix expressed doubt that their electrical subcontractor could work with my old switchboard so arranged for an inspection from their electrical contractor which confirmed my fear. Economix then assisted in me getting a more favorable price for the switchboard renewal from their electrical subcontractor and sharpened their price to alleviate the overall extra cost. That is why I rate their service highly.I settled on an SMA Sunny Boy inverter after reading a number of reviews. I enquired with SMA Australia regarding bluetoothing info from it to my laptop. Received a prompt reply from them and they provided me with a free copy of their \"Sunny Explorer\" monitoring software. Another good experience.I also rate the information on your site highly.",
